nspawn (1.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The mstack backend is experimental and opt-in; auto is overlay everywhere.
  * systemd 262 cannot boot managed user namespaces: mstack is refused there.

 -- Eduard Tolosa <tolosaeduard@gmail.com>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 20:00:00 -0500

nspawn (1.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Several networks per machine with aliases, ports on one host address.
  * Healthchecks, secrets, docker's other run flags, restart, pause and top.

 -- Eduard Tolosa <tolosaeduard@gmail.com>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0500

nspawn (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

